      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I'll write an improved version that enhances understandability through better structure, descriptive assertion messages, and logical grouping into focused test methods.Now I'll compile-check the file.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version splits the original single `testEncode` method into three focused test methods (`testEncode_caseInsensitivity`, `testEncode_commonEnglishWords`, and `testEncode_staticUsEnglishInstanceMatchesDefaultInstance`), adds a class-level Javadoc explaining the encoding algorithm and coverage scope, and includes per-assertion messages that name the input and expected code so any future failure immediately pinpoints the regression."
